text One girl taking two guys out on her own?
sound CO.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text There's no way.
text @[Tomoya]
text You were watching, weren't you? You can't deny reality.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSH13B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
