text That had to have been an act. I bet those guys were just a couple of plants.
sound CQ.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text It's got to be why they did it so far away from everyone. That way people wouldn't catch on.
sound CR.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Plus it was like, the perfect place to get attention. A little too perfect.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSH15B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
