text And now, lo and behold, she's starting to get popular because of it.
sound CT.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Coincidence? I think not. It was just a cheap ruse that worked because the kids at our school don't know what a real fight looks like.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSH13B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGSH13B.png
